      "title": "Data Center - Santa Barbara City College",
      "url": "https://www.sbcc.edu/institutionalresearch/data.php",
      "summary": "The page is a centralized location for accessing Santa Barbara City College's institutional research data, including student achievement metrics, high school transitions, and other important reports such as the 2023 IPEDS Data Feedback Report and the Institutional Effectiveness Reports. The page also provides links to institutional planning and additional resources.",
      "stored": false,
